: "005.png", "id": "1039875214854716", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393516_1039875218188049_231288402583328065_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iaG7ajl-U2sQ7kNvwEkmroK&_nc_oc=AdrLJDwF7pknt5t8gj09KX2ksAaSIRgBDKYnjoWmbRCNAPR4DEQu03r4OYC9-0lIQ4o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0WCyqwDdwk69AfhA8luR8LwvLSbDRreCQYgudPrs5PDQ&oe=69DCE267"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "005.png", "id": "517509354762187", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391952_517509358095520_2919512691968294005_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qk3gQ5wuxGgQ7kNvwHNiZ5S&_nc_oc=Adqm_OvrhaIO933u2pDjaxrj8Hy9FID3OI8E6UuO0fjp6U0vk4SAugzYQ9KxIZXsmnY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2BN3pDUdGZCGuKVaS94nep5doM7ETsAZtvdSDu1OBtrg&oe=69DCFD89"}, "display_name": "Legends BMX", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Legends BMX VR** brings BMX action to Mixed Reality on Meta Quest. Overlay 3D bikeparks onto your real-world environment using passthrough and ride freely within your space.\n\n- Resize the track to fit your room.  \n- Link up insane tricks and climb the global rankings.  \n- Join weekly challenges and compete on *online leaderboards*.\n\n**Actively developed, but already solid and fun**  \nWhile we're actively improving and expanding the game, this VR version already offers a complete and stable experience. *Legends BMX* is also being developed for PC and consoles, where it's being very well received.\n\nJump into the park and help us fine-tune the final experience.  \nThanks for being part of the journey \u2014 see you in the park!\n", "short_description": "Pure flow and adrenaline \u2014 now in Mixed Reality!\nRide your BMX through dynamic parks superimposed on your real-world space. Pull off insane tricks, chase high scores, and feel the thrill of BMX in a whole new way."}]}, "developer_name": null, "develope